WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:29.510
The moment the Ideon and Solo Ship united,

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:32.870
the power of the Ide might have increased.

00:01:33.610 --> 00:01:37.400
Its glow destroyed the Heavy Mobile Mecha Abzonol

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:38.830
and terrified everyone.

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:45.250
Meanwhile...

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:47.330
Gije and Karala went to rescue Bes and Cosmo,

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:50.130
who were taken prisoner by the Earth Union Military.

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:52.500
They ran into Bes' parents.

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:58.340
However, they parted ways without
 saying a word to each other.

00:01:59.220 --> 00:02:05.210
<b>Amidst the Flames of Fate</b>

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:24.190
There it is!

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:35.080
In the fluid inside, there are telepathy-emitting
 microbes called Quarong Tomoros.

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:37.460
I don't see them...

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:39.990
You'd need a microscope for that.

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:43.910
So they've known our location because of this...

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:50.840
We're still being followed.

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:52.960
Is it an Earth Union Military ship?

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:56.130
We haven't been ordered on combat standby.

00:02:57.070 --> 00:03:00.400
In that case, we should find the biosensors first.

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:02.600
There should be about five or six of them left.

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:03.780
Roger!

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:21.990
As of today, Jordan Bes and the
 rest of the Solo Ship crew...

00:03:21.990 --> 00:03:25.470
are incorporated into the Earth Union Military.

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:29.240
Commander Leclan will inform you about the procedures.

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:38.470
They're so blantant, I can't even get angry.

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:40.560
Really, you can't be serious.

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:42.900
I see how it is.

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:45.700
Is there no way for us to settle our differences?

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:46.910
You're far too selfish.

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:47.700
That's right.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:50.830
We'd be idiots to transfer to the Union Military now!

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.750
We're not going to fight anymore!

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:55.880
We're going where neither the Earth
nor Buff Clan can find us.

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:57.870
I've had enough of fighting!

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:01.400
This is what the higher-ups ordered. Don't get angry.

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:05.810
Is the Union Military depending on us to protect Earth?

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:10.580
I don't believe the Earth expects that much from you...

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:21.520
Don't cry! You're a man, aren't you?

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:25.030
But it hurts!

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:32.370
From now on, you need to learn
 how to endure on your own!

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:35.570
You can't give up that easily, Fard!

00:04:35.820 --> 00:04:36.900
Be a man!

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:42.530
Stand up, Fard!

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:45.840
You can't force him all of a sudden, Moera.

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:48.320
But he's being such a coward.

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:52.550
Fard, it's like Moera said.

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:54.370
You have to stand up by yourself.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:57.590
Aren't you being too soft on him, Rapoh?

00:04:58.230 --> 00:04:59.700
It all depends on the situation.

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:01.460
You have to take his feelings into account.

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:03.240
I guess...

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:07.200
But Fard, it's like Moera said.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.620
You have to grow stronger.

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:22.690
The Adigos have been handed over.

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:25.860
I hope you'll do better from now on.

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:29.290
You wouldn't be making wisecracks
 if you knew about the Giant.

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:32.360
It's not to be taken lightly.

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:40.150
I'll leave Kulara to take care of things here.

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:43.300
If you're having problems, instruct her as you see fit.

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:46.150
This is a battleground.

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:46.930
Are you prepared?

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:48.150
Yes, ma'am.

00:05:48.150 --> 00:05:50.610
Well then, Lady Rukuku, good luck.

00:05:57.410 --> 00:05:59.560
Daram's letter to Harulu...

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:04.780
Harulu...

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:06.820
Where should I begin?

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:11.420
From the days when I turned down the
 daughter of Supreme Commander Doba?

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:17.200
Or the times when we grew up like
 brother and sister in the forests of Kilm?

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:19.440
I could never forget...

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:22.110
Is this his testament?

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:27.150
I was so young back then...

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:30.390
And I might have been jealous of your fighting abilities.

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:33.300
I heard that Daram Zuba's ship was sunk...

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:37.280
I'm a mere drifter these days,
 but I can't forget about you.

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:43.090
I'm starting to blush.

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:45.890
It's like I'm listening to some intimate lover's talk...

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:52.340
Lady Rukuku!

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:54.120
What are you doing here?

00:06:54.530 --> 00:06:57.180
I thought you'd like to hear the news from the homeland.

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:58.520
I've heard already!

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:01.690
But did you know that Supreme
 Commander Doba himself...

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:04.150
is heading out to lead our forces against the Giant?

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:06.870
That's the first I've heard of that...

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:13.870
Only three minutes to the target point.

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:14.910
Okay!

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:17.520
We're going to start the decoy plan. Are you ready?

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:22.690
Don't you think that Leclan's
 Goricky will hinder us, though?

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:25.170
They're allies. Don't hate them.

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:26.990
I'm against this!

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:30.170
The Ideon will lure the enemies in front of the Solo Ship.

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:32.470
There won't be a chance for Leclan to get involved.

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:33.990
You make it sound easy.

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:35.080
Enemy ship spotted!

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:38.440
There's a gravitational field near the fourth planet!

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:39.460
It has to be the Buff Clan!

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:41.350
All units, head out!

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:42.130
I'm counting on you!

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:43.400
I'll be there soon!

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:44.220
Hurry!

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:56.440
Fard!

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:58.320
Are you going to sortie?

00:07:58.320 --> 00:08:00.820
Yes. You all should take refuge in the center of the ship.

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:05.290
Fard, you can't always hide behind Ashura's back.

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:06.750
What is it, Moera?

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:08.500
No, it's nothing.

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:10.670
I've just become concerned about him all of a sudden.

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:11.780
Understand, Fard?

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:17.080
Moera...

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:18.400
Okay!

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:20.460
Sol-Amber, ready to launch!

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:24.380
Sol-Conver, ready to launch!

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:28.800
You're late!

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:29.520
Sorry!

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:31.090
Ideo-Nova, ready to launch!

00:08:31.480 --> 00:08:32.820
Roger, all units launch!

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:43.300
Rapoh and Fard...

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:47.210
The Solo Ship will be safe as long as I'm here!

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:48.120
What'd you say, Moera?

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:50.130
No, nothing.

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:51.960
Is there something wrong with our defense?

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:57.340
Up until now, I've always thought
 of humanity's fate as something bad.

00:08:57.340 --> 00:08:58.390
Fate?

00:08:58.390 --> 00:08:59.300
Yeah.

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:00.880
But I'm going to stop, Vent.

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:01.760
Stop what?

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:04.640
I've found there's a good side to fate.

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:06.590
Good side to fate?

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:09.770
I have Rapoh and the kids...
 I didn't even realize that!

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:10.610
Rapoh...

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:12.130
You like her?

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:13.760
What's wrong with that?

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:15.910
What's so funny?

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:18.180
A man's whim won't last for long!

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:19.620
It's not a whim!

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:20.990
I'm serious!

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:21.540
Let's go!

00:09:24.950 --> 00:09:26.000
Hey, hold it!

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.730
Don't provoke Moera like that!

00:09:27.730 --> 00:09:28.880
It's gotten to his head.

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:30.460
Is this okay?

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:31.880
I suppose.

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:33.540
Isn't it fine to get fired up?

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:36.800
Lady Rukuku!

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:40.010
The enemy is about to escape
 from this planetary system!

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:41.180
All right.

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:43.140
If we first ambush them from subspace,

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:45.180
where will we come in contact with them?

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:47.010
Most likely near the sixth planet!

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:50.650
The Garowa Zan and Majis Zan
will head to the sixth planet.

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:55.220
The Jim Zan will assault the enemy
 en route and lure them near the planet.

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:56.770
Jim Zan, launching!

00:09:57.950 --> 00:09:59.530
Good luck.

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:00.900
Lure them out for me.

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:11.130
This ship will enter subspace in five seconds!

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:12.420
I know.

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:15.090
If Lady Rukuku gets to know about this, I'll...

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:17.140
Lady Harulu will take care of that.

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:18.380
Well then...

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:23.140
I've received your message.

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:28.270
It's hard for me to forgive Rukuku Kil
for ridiculing Daram's last words.

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:29.390
Yes.

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:31.650
Take back Daram's video card.

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:32.940
Yes!

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:33.610
Also...

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:38.850
No matter what the situation is,
 use any means necessary.

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:41.560
Kill Rukuku Kil.

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:43.540
Yes, ma'am.

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:47.080
If you manage to succeed...

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:51.250
I'll thank you as a woman, Kulara.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:53.040
Certainly.

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:01.840
My sympathies, Lady Harulu.

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:09.100
The Solo Ship says they're going to
lure them to the sixth planet.

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:12.980
Did Bes realize we aren't used to DS Fights?

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:14.900
Follow the Solo Ship and prepare for battle!

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:16.970
Have we reached them?

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:27.300
Those machines again. They're stubborn!

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:28.130
I know!

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:33.410
Damn you!

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:40.560
How about that?

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:41.890
You're not getting near the Solo Ship!

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:49.180
See!

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:49.890
Who's next?

00:11:56.770 --> 00:11:58.320
Don't be hasty, Moera!

00:11:58.320 --> 00:11:59.570
I'm alright!

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:00.740
I'm in a good mood right now!

00:12:21.460 --> 00:12:22.010
Deck!

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:23.470
Where's the enemy ship?

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:24.090
It's close!

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:25.750
It's entering the range of our missiles!

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:31.680
It's about time for us to DS out!

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:32.880
Can you hear me?

00:12:32.880 --> 00:12:34.850
Okay! We're going to DS Out!

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:36.840
All units, gather above the Solo Ship!

00:12:38.060 --> 00:12:38.820
Cosmo!

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:40.280
We've got to return to the Solo Ship!

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:40.970
Roger!

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:46.570
Release the barrier and fire straight ahead!

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:48.110
Recover all the Ideon units!

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:49.530
Here we go!

00:12:49.530 --> 00:12:51.070
Releasing the barrier!

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:05.800
The Solo Ship stopped their DS Drive?

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:06.830
All ships, follow!

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:19.730
Hey! The mother ship is gone!

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:31.160
All hands, keep your battle positions.

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:34.660
The enemy must have noticed our DS Out. 
They'll be here soon!

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:35.610
Roger!

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:38.080
They have relocated near the Sixth Planet!

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:39.570
All right, just as planned.

00:13:39.570 --> 00:13:41.960
We'll surround and annihilate them.

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:43.490
Get out us of subspace, now!

00:13:43.490 --> 00:13:44.040
Yes, ma'am!

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:53.890
Majis Zan, Jis Zan, confirm your location.

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:56.730
Dispatch all the Adigos at once!

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:57.390
Kulara!

00:13:57.560 --> 00:13:59.650
We don't have enough components! Take a look!

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:01.690
That can't be true!

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:03.760
There should be more than enough spare parts!

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:07.650
There are still missiles in block 132!

00:14:07.670 --> 00:14:08.950
Yeah, give me a moment.

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:11.320
That kid!

00:14:11.320 --> 00:14:12.450
Alright! Alright!

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:13.700
Fard!

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:17.140
Didn't you understand a thing I said?!

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:21.540
Even Ashura is working, what are
you sitting around staring for?

00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:23.140
Moera!

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:25.060
What's the matter with you?

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:26.010
Moera!

00:14:26.710 --> 00:14:27.330
Rapoh.

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:31.300
You shouldn't scold a child like Fard so much.

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:33.060
When I see him, I get irritated.

00:14:33.090 --> 00:14:34.920
I used to be like him a long time ago.

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:37.380
You have to teach him little by little.

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:38.430
I know!

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:40.810
Don't lose to Ashura!

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:45.000
Don't give up, Fard.

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:50.610
Are they here?

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:54.450
Yes sir! Three ships are approaching
 from left, right and front!

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:56.660
So the rear side is empty...

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:57.970
Contact the Solo Ship!

00:14:57.970 --> 00:14:58.450
Yes sir!

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:00.160
What is it?

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:01.290
What do you think?

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:02.710
Our rear side is empty...

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:04.320
I think it's an enemy trap.

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:06.120
There are Mobile Mecha coming.

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:07.330
I see.

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:09.270
At the same time the Ideon launches,

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:12.790
the Solo Ship will get behind the
 flagship and commence a pincer attack.

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:14.760
Are we bait?!

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:19.430
No, I have faith in the Goricky, even if we were to fail.

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:22.030
Roger, Bes.

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:26.690
Ideon, prepare to launch!

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:29.770
We'll hide in the planet's ring and 
approach the enemy ship in front.

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:32.110
All hands, take your stations!

00:15:33.110 --> 00:15:34.060
Moera!

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:39.120
Hurry!

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:40.440
What is it, Fard?

00:15:42.530 --> 00:15:45.160
I don't need this anymore, Moera.

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:46.000
Fard...

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:47.460
Is that true?

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:49.840
I can do fine without it.

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:51.720
Are you sure?

00:15:56.900 --> 00:16:00.080
It might be hard at first, but try your best!

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:02.510
You don't want to be scolded again, do you?

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:05.610
Moera!

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:06.520
Yeah!

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:07.930
Rapoh, take care of him.

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:09.030
Yeah.

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:09.840
Bye!

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:11.140
Take care!

00:16:11.140 --> 00:16:12.030
Thank you.

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:15.740
Do your best!

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:20.900
Rapoh, do you love Moera?

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:32.640
It's an ambush!

00:16:32.640 --> 00:16:33.620
Did our plan fail?

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:39.180
The Adigo squadron is in battle with the Giant!

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:41.090
All right, they took the the initiative!

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:46.520
Prepare the Ideon Gun!

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:49.280
Don't take too long or the Goricky will be in danger.

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:55.280
Let's go!

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:56.320
Contact the Ideon!

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:57.520
Launching the Ideon Gun!

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:00.610
Ideon, take the Ideon Gun!

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:07.420
Cosmo, the Ideon Gun!

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:08.280
I know!

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:37.720
Captain! We can't hold out
 against the enemy missiles!

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:38.560
We're staying!

00:17:38.560 --> 00:17:41.020
If we retreat, what happens to the Solo Ship?

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:55.560
Good, that ship won't last much longer.

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:56.840
Fire at the Giant!

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:03.000
At this rate, the Ideon will be destroyed!

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:07.510
That's the commander's ship!

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:10.470
Kasha! Sorry, but I'm docking out!

00:18:10.760 --> 00:18:12.690
We'll be fine! Go ahead!

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:18.120
A lucky hit!

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:24.410
One part of the Giant has separated!

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:25.810
Its mobility has decreased!

00:18:25.810 --> 00:18:26.660
Adigo Squad!

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:28.000
Focus your attack on it!

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:35.880
Go down!

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:51.780
Oh no! It latched onto us!

00:18:54.770 --> 00:18:55.900
Moera, let's get out!

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:56.800
Don't be a fool!

00:18:56.920 --> 00:18:57.560
Cosmo!

00:18:57.560 --> 00:18:58.690
The enemy's in front!

00:18:58.690 --> 00:18:59.600
Use the Ideon Gun!

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:05.620
All right, only a bit more. We can do it!

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:08.710
They're so persistent!

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:13.360
Cosmo! The energy is rising!

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:14.360
Use the Ideon Gun...

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:16.300
But your cockpit...

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:23.170
Target the Giant only! Just a few hits more!

00:19:23.170 --> 00:19:24.340
Harulu?

00:19:24.340 --> 00:19:28.240
Yes, I'll take revenge in Lady Harulu's place.

00:19:28.560 --> 00:19:29.810
Revenge?

00:19:29.810 --> 00:19:33.620
You ridiculed the last message of Sir Daram.

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:35.220
I don't understand...

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:42.060
Cosmo!

00:19:43.610 --> 00:19:44.240
Let's do it!

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:48.700
Cosmo!

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:01.500
Did it work?

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:25.240
This light...

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:28.020
It's the light that will change our fate!

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:54.720
Go ahead... Do it.

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:56.020
Rapoh.

00:20:56.020 --> 00:20:57.060
No!

00:20:57.480 --> 00:20:58.480
No!

00:20:58.480 --> 00:20:59.190
Rapoh!

00:20:59.190 --> 00:20:59.980
Get a hold of yourself!

00:20:59.980 --> 00:21:00.760
Joliver!

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:01.750
Yes.

00:21:04.180 --> 00:21:05.590
He's leaving...

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:07.580
Moera's leaving!

00:21:10.030 --> 00:21:11.160
Moera!

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:16.030
Moera! Moera! Moera!

00:21:16.360 --> 00:21:19.380
I'll get strong!

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:38.060
Let's have faith that the Ide won't destroy us.

00:21:38.060 --> 00:21:45.600
None of you leaked anything about Karala or
Gije to Leclan or anyone else from Earth.

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:51.080
I'd like to believe that we have some kind
of harmony aboard the Solo Ship.

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:56.520
Let's nurture that harmony
somewhere in the universe.

00:21:56.750 --> 00:21:58.550
We'll find ourselves a second Earth.

00:21:59.330 --> 00:22:00.100
That's right.

00:22:01.140 --> 00:22:01.640
Bes?!

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:03.440
Bes!

00:22:03.880 --> 00:22:04.530
Bes!

00:22:05.050 --> 00:22:06.420
Bes! Bes!

00:22:06.610 --> 00:22:07.420
What's wrong?!

00:22:07.420 --> 00:22:08.800
He has a horrible fever!

00:22:08.800 --> 00:22:09.550
Bes!

00:22:09.550 --> 00:22:09.920
Hey!

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:13.010
Bes has collapsed! Call the nurse!

00:22:13.030 --> 00:22:13.880
What's wrong?

00:22:13.940 --> 00:22:15.890
Bes collapsed?!

00:22:29.990 --> 00:22:31.890
The people on the Solo Ship...

00:22:32.580 --> 00:22:39.040
would never again see the glow
of these familiar stars.

00:22:50.970 --> 00:22:52.220
<i>Moera has died.</i>

00:22:52.720 --> 00:22:54.750
<i>Bes has collapsed from an illness.</i>

00:22:55.180 --> 00:23:00.100
<i>The Solo Ship crew decides to let Gije pilot the Ideon.</i>

00:23:01.350 --> 00:23:03.970
<i>They try to break through the
 new Heavy Mobile Mecha's trap.</i>

00:23:04.110 --> 00:23:08.560
<i>Will Gije go back to the enemy
and betray the Solo Ship?</i>

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:12.490
<i>Next time on Legendary Giant Ideon,</i>

00:23:13.260 --> 00:23:17.820
<b>Waft Area Gamble</b>

00:23:13.260 --> 00:23:17.820
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:17.400
<i><i>Space Runaway!</i></i>

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:35.850
tatta hitotsu no hoshi ni suterare

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:35.850
<i>I've been abandoned merely by one world</i>

00:23:37.140 --> 00:23:43.190
owarinai tabi kimi to ayumu to

00:23:37.140 --> 00:23:43.190
<i>As I walk this endless journey together with you</i>

00:23:43.480 --> 00:23:48.740
itsukushimi futo wakeatte

00:23:43.480 --> 00:23:48.740
<i>We unexpectedly share our affection</i>

00:23:49.700 --> 00:23:56.120
kizu wo nameau douke shibai

00:23:49.700 --> 00:23:56.120
<i>Feeling sympathy for each other in this farcical play</i>

00:23:56.450 --> 00:24:02.210
kosumosu sora wo kakenukete

00:23:56.450 --> 00:24:02.210
<i>Traveling through the skies of cosmos</i>

00:24:02.830 --> 00:24:08.800
inori wo ima kimi no moto e

00:24:02.830 --> 00:24:08.800
<i>I'll send a prayer your way</i>

00:24:09.130 --> 00:24:14.760
kosumosu sora wo kakenukete

00:24:09.130 --> 00:24:14.760
<i>Traveling through the skies of cosmos</i>

00:24:15.470 --> 00:24:22.150
inori wo ima kimi no moto e

00:24:15.470 --> 00:24:22.150
<i>I'll send a prayer your way</i>
